    "note_tweet": {
      "entities": {},
      "text": "Bin & Zeus\nThe screen is filled with a gentle pink atmosphere, delicately capturing the fluttering emotions of a youthful crush. Hidden within the scenes are the cautious, tender feelings between a boy and a girl; the camera freezes the moment they meet, while fragments of heartfelt confessions spread across the frame. Every shot carries a sweetness that belongs only to youth.\n\nThere is no dramatic or cliché storyline — only the softness and sincerity of two people slowly moving toward each other. The long-buried words “I like you” are gently spoken at last, making this a healing, sweet romance film perfect to watch with someone you like."
    },
